{"id":488,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"学習活動と教育課程が柱の相模原中等","feature_description":"相模原中等教育学校の特色は『学習活動』と『教育課程』の二本柱で、6年制の中等教育学校として前期・後期の学びを一体で設計しています。校内の部活動も体育系12、文化系8と幅広く、学習と活動を両立しながら自分の得意分野を伸ばせる環境です。部活動ページでは前期課程・後期課程の人数も示され、継続的な活動が分かります。学校案内全体でも中高一貫の構成が明快です。","clubs":[{"id":9711,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9712,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9713,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9714,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9715,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9716,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9717,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9718,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9719,"name":"野球部〖前期課程は軟式、後期課程は硬式〗","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9720,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9721,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed